    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/2/82694.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 128,
    "turn_text": "So finally, Congresswoman, I have to imagine that you are an important perspective back in Washington, swing district, newly elected somebody that your party cares very much about re-electing. So for your colleagues and helping them understand what's going on in America and how all of this is landing, what are you going to make sure that they hear when you get back to DC that you've learned from these events that you just did with voters?",
